Fork notice

This copy is a fork of rtravellin/muse-code-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/rtravellin/muse-code-plugin-cc), maintained at
https://github.com/webandseo/muse-plugin-cc. Files in it were modified by
webandseo in 2026. The changes are:

- privacy defaults: every `muse exec` passes --no-foreign-personal-context
  (opt out with MUSE_CC_FOREIGN_CONTEXT=1), and runs default to the spark
  model (muse-spark-1.3) or MUSE_CC_MODEL instead of Muse's contributor
  default;
- delegate runs: a guard against concurrent write-capable runs in one
  checkout, and subagent instructions that never re-run a backgrounded run;
- Windows: a process liveness check that works without `ps`;
- /muse:transfer: --model and --effort are forwarded to Muse;
- packaging: marketplace renamed to webandseo-muse, version 0.2.0,
  changelog, README and test updates.
